This package's output follows DCAT-US Schema v3.0, the United States federal data catalog metadata standard
(https://resources.data.gov/resources/dcat-us3/), maintained by the Data.gov program at GSA and governed by the Federal
CDO Council's Tiger Team, an application profile of the W3C Data Catalog Vocabulary version 3. The JSON Schema
definitions, examples and validation script in data/ are copied from https://github.com/GSA/dcat-us at a pinned
commit; they are a work of the United States Government (17 USC § 105) released under CC0 1.0, and keep that status
here. The sdccdif package loader and model reader are reused from https://github.com/SemanticDataCharter/sdc_cdif.
